{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n みんな大好き鬼教官さんに\n 私の写真を撮ってもらいました〜📸\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJAGY6MDDB6F3KXN5ZY37R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 鬼教官の指定のポーズで！\n これなんのポーズかわかりますか？\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJAHY88NG1K3PNQN6D1WSD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n MVのソロパートでやってるポーズです！\n 私ですら忘れてたのによく覚えてますね！\n さすが鬼教官👹\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJAJXWMMRZBEZ99NQXSAKE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJAKXGK7ZGJV9V4TYBFJDS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJAMWTVHHJ492WQRH2B51C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJANWR5QF70534EAS1RHYA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n あ！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJAPWA5MFKJ52ZKGKMQJP3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 髪の毛の触覚を増やした方が\n 可愛くなれるんじゃないかと\n 熱弁し始める私🤣\n \n ちなみに私の髪型は\n 毎回鬼教官が悩みに悩んで考えてます！\n \n もうなんでもいいです〜って言ってるのに\n しつこいくらいに私の髪を考えてます！\n \n 私より私の髪型にこだわってる鬼教官👹\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJAQZT6SVA8RVV0Z2FBKSQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ここの輪郭が気になるんですよ〜の図↑\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJAS1AW6H2A4RRGR6S4SY5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n あの〜ここがら横の毛を出して\n 顔を小さく見せたいんですけど〜の図🤣↑\n \n \n \n 鬼教官目線を新企画にしたいです〜\n って言ったら\n まおの写真撮り続けるなんてやだよ😏\n って言われました笑\n \n \n それではまた！"}],"source":"archive"}